    {
      "clause_id": "SPEC-ORD-004/R1",
      "spec_id": "SPEC-ORD-004",
      "title": "订单列表按创建时间筛选",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "proposed",
      "heading": "参数形态",
      "body": "`GET /orders` 新增可选查询参数 `created_after`，取值为 ISO-8601 日历日期，格式固定为 `YYYY-MM-DD`。参数缺省时行为与当前版本一致；参数出现且非空时进入 R2 的过滤逻辑。",
      "role": "required",
      "source": {
        "path": "specs/SPEC-ORD-004-created-after.md",
        "line_start": 12,
        "line_end": 14
      },
      "score": 26,
      "reason": "任务关键词命中"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "SPEC-ORD-004/R2",
      "spec_id": "SPEC-ORD-004",
      "title": "订单列表按创建时间筛选",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "proposed",
      "heading": "过滤语义",
      "body": "过滤条件是 `created_at` 的日期部分大于等于 `created_after`，比较按日历日进行，不受时区偏移影响。边界当天的订单必须全部包含：`00:00:00` 与 `23:59:59` 的订单都算命中，边界前一天 `23:59:59` 的订单必须排除。",
      "role": "required",
      "source": {
        "path": "specs/SPEC-ORD-004-created-after.md",
        "line_start": 16,
        "line_end": 18
      },
      "score": 36,
      "reason": "任务关键词命中"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "SPEC-ORD-004/R3",
      "spec_id": "SPEC-ORD-004",
      "title": "订单列表按创建时间筛选",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "proposed",
      "heading": "非法输入",
      "body": "`created_after` 无法按 `YYYY-MM-DD` 解析时（例如 `2026-13-01`、`2026-9-1`、空值、非日期文本），接口返回 HTTP 400，响应体 `error.code` 为 `invalid_created_after`，并沿用 SPEC-API-001 的错误信封。",
      "role": "required",
      "source": {
        "path": "specs/SPEC-ORD-004-created-after.md",
        "line_start": 20,
        "line_end": 22
      },
      "score": 27,
      "reason": "任务关键词命中"
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "SPEC-ORD-004/R4",
      "spec_id": "SPEC-ORD-004",
      "title": "订单列表按创建时间筛选",
      "version": 1,
      "status": "proposed",
      "heading": "与既有筛选、分页的组合",
      "body": "`created_after` 必须能和 `status`、`min_total`、`page`、`page_size` 同时使用：先做全部过滤，再排序，最后分页；`total` 与 `pages` 按过滤后的集合计算，不得按过滤前的集合计算。",
      "role": "required",
      "source": {
        "path": "specs/SPEC-ORD-004-created-after.md",
        "line_start": 24,
        "line_end": 26
      },
      "score": 30,
      "reason": "任务关键词命中"
    },
